error[L0404]: `(iterator (ref str))` does not implement `joinable`
 --> check/join_iterator.knv:2:9
  |
2 |   (join (split text " ") ", "))
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this needs `joinable`
  |
  = note: `joinable` is implemented for: (where ((text (borrow str))) (vec text)), (where ((text (borrow str))) (slice text))
  = help: `join` takes a vector or a slice: collect an iterator first, as in `(join (collect items) ", ")`, which allocates the vector
